This is the source code, content and images for following along in the book **Designing Websites with Publii and GitHub** Pages by Brad Moore.  

[Get it here](https://www.amazon.com/Designing-Websites-Publii-GitHub-Pages/dp/B0DLSWJYQ4)

Included is a tar file (spacebs-moonshot-final.tar) containing the completed project that is developed when following along in the book.  It is a backup file can be added to Publii following the instructions in chapter 9.

